<title>SWITZERLAND: Union Re reports higher profit.</title>
<headline>Union Re reports higher profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1995.</p>
<p>				   (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pretax profit	  37.39	     vs 21.28</p>
<p> Gross premium income	 1,285	     vs 1,321</p>
<p>Net investment income</p>
<p> (incl. value adjustments)  114.46	    vs 70.38</p>
<p> Total investments	    2,228	     vs 1,823</p>
<p> Total assets		   2,484	     vs 2,366</p>
<p>Note -- Full name Union Reinsurance Co. Company is a unit of Swiss Reinsurance Co.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial + 41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
